        "original_id": "1a837c54-f7cd-52cb-b6b3-e4a2d21d1855",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leni Riefenstahl, Karl Attenberger, Annie Sundberg, Ricki Stern, Naomi Wolf\n- Works: Triumph of the Will, The End of America, Lowlands\n- Topics: propaganda films, documentary films, film adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- In 1935, Leni Riefenstahl directed, produced, edited, and co-wrote the German propaganda film Triumph of the Will.\n- In 1935, Karl Attenberger worked with Leni Riefenstahl on the propaganda documentary Triumph of the Will.\n- Lowlands was later adapted into a sound film titled Lowlands, which was directed by and starred Leni Riefenstahl.\n- Naomi Wolf wrote the 2007 book that The End of America adapted.\n- In 2008, Annie Sundberg and Ricki Stern directed the documentary film The End of America.",
